WEBVTT

00:02:56.630 --> 00:03:00.260
you want to switch on a bulb
using a remote control.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:03.240
For the signal to reach the bulb,
it would take about 20 minutes.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:08.260
And then to confirm whether the bulb
is switched on or not, another 20 minutes.

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:13.090
Which meant that we would have to create
such a smart system,

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:17.880
which would mostly be able 
to look after itself; that is,

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:22.150
in case of any faults, it should be able
to identify and rectify them,

00:03:22.150 --> 00:03:27.680
and also diligently follow
the instructions already fed into it.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:33.650
Because even the smallest mistake 
could cost us the entire mission.